      "text": [
        "Fixture Bank Limited — Illustrative Backward-Lineage Trace",
        "Powered by DGIW",
        "How these points were selected",
        "234 consumption points are reachable in this scope. The 3 traced here are the top of a ranking, not a choice: points are ordered",
        "by how many in-scope elements feed them, then by the in-scope DQ rule count across those elements, then by name. All three",
        "keys are deterministic and all three are computed under the active layer, so a core-only engagement legitimately traces a",
